{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"発表されましたね〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は二列目の真ん中でごさいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の前は初センターのいくちゃん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強との両立大変かもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも私が全力で支える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆もついてる！！大丈夫よん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと、このシングルは勝負だと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆が同じ目標を持っていないと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃ、選抜、アンダー、研究生。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれいろんな想いかあると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれが普通です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、LIVEや作品を創る時位は皆で一緒に一生懸命にならないと出来ないのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく握手会で言われます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は二列目だけど〜。。とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな所で、必ず毎回もう生駒はないな。ここになんであいつがいるんだ⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう言われるのも仕方ない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは私が過去実際にやってしまった失敗とかだし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを挽回したいから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のチャンスを増やしたいから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今一生懸命頑張るんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのポジションでも私にとってはチャンスです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから頑張るんだ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと乃木坂を広めたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくれる人、ファンになってくださる方沢山いるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その人に早く恩返し出来る様に力つけたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"兼任してから、改めて自分の無力さを知りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足りなすぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな自分じゃ何も出来やしない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強くなりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だんだん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこんなアイドルになりたいと見えてきた所があります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのためにも頑張らなくちゃね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/08/05/0009147/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"}